        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.75,
          "end": 8.7,
          "en": "our newly gained knowledge to improve this overall layout.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.7,
          "end": 10.59,
          "en": "One thing I will do for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.59,
          "end": 12.97,
          "en": "is work on this app container padding.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.97,
          "end": 15.97,
          "en": "This actually doesn't use any of the new knowledge",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.97,
          "end": 19.103,
          "en": "but I need to do this to make this look a bit prettier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.27,
          "end": 24.34,
          "en": "I basically just want to have a padding to the top of 50",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.34,
          "end": 27.61,
          "en": "and then I wanna have a padding horizontal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.61,
          "end": 30.36,
          "en": "so left and right of 16.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.36,
          "end": 32.363,
          "en": "So not of 50 but of 16.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.24,
          "end": 37.91,
          "en": "With that I'd say, this generally looks better,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.91,
          "end": 41.84,
          "en": "though we can see that this padding is kind of ignored",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.84,
          "end": 45.993,
          "en": "and our button here is going off the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 47.52,
          "end": 50.83,
          "en": "This can be fixed by decreasing the amount of width",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 50.83,
          "end": 55.15,
          "en": "our text input has to 70% maybe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 55.15,
          "end": 57.35,
          "en": "Now this looks better.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 57.35,
          "end": 61.32,
          "en": "What doesn't look better though is where this text is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 61.32,
          "end": 62.64,
          "en": "in this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.64,
          "end": 66.48,
          "en": "This is something we can improve with align items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 66.48,
          "end": 68.063,
          "en": "on the input container though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.21000000000001,
          "end": 72.11,
          "en": "At the moment, the problem is that basically this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 72.11,
          "end": 76.65,
          "en": "is stretched to be as high as this text input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 76.65,
          "end": 78.87,
          "en": "And the text is then not centered in the button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 78.87,
          "end": 80.99,
          "en": "because the button doesn't have any styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 80.99,
          "end": 83.09,
          "en": "that would center the text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 83.09,
          "end": 85.65,
          "en": "Now you could think that maybe we can add some styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.65,
          "end": 88.78,
          "en": "to the button but it turned out that the button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.78,
          "end": 92.53,
          "en": "is a component that doesn't have a style prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.53,
          "end": 94.75999999999999,
          "en": "It might look like it has because I'm getting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.75999999999999,
          "end": 97.93,
          "en": "some auto completion here but that's actually only some",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.93,
          "end": 101.8,
          "en": "auto completion I get here because I typed the word style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 101.8,
          "end": 103.333,
          "en": "before in this code file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.19,
          "end": 107.57,
          "en": "The proper auto completion that tells me that a certain prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 107.57,
          "end": 111.38,
          "en": "is supported looks like this with this kind of icon",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.38,
          "end": 112.66,
          "en": "next to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 112.66,
          "end": 114.78,
          "en": "So the button doesn't have a style prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.78,
          "end": 117.173,
          "en": "because indeed it doesn't support styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 118.67,
          "end": 121.74,
          "en": "You can always check out the official docs and dive into",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 121.74,
          "end": 125.163,
          "en": "an element there to see which props it supports.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 126.25,
          "end": 129,
          "en": "And for example, on the button, there is no style prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 130.24,
          "end": 134.593,
          "en": "Whereas on the view, for example, you do find a style prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 136.04,
          "end": 138.73,
          "en": "But that's just a side note, that's why we have to fix it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 138.73,
          "end": 142.89,
          "en": "differently and we can fix it by not stretching this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 142.89,
          "end": 145.69,
          "en": "That would be one way of achieving this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.69,
          "end": 148.98,
          "en": "So we can set a line items here on input container",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 148.98,
          "end": 153.183,
          "en": "and set this to center instead of stretch.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 154.73,
          "end": 158.76,
          "en": "With that, the button is now centered and looks better.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 158.76,
          "end": 160.7,
          "en": "We could also build our own button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 160.7,
          "end": 162.85,
          "en": "but that is something you will learn later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 163.86,
          "end": 166.24,
          "en": "So now this looks better.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 166.24,
          "end": 170.16,
          "en": "I also wanna change how much space this input area takes up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 170.16,
          "end": 173.49,
          "en": "though and how much space the list of goals takes up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 173.49,
          "end": 176.35,
          "en": "To achieve this, I'll do a couple of things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 176.35,
          "end": 180.69,
          "en": "For example, I wanna add some padding to the bottom",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 180.69,
          "end": 184.67,
          "en": "on this input container of let's say 24.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 184.67,
          "end": 188.13,
          "en": "so that there is some space between the view that holds",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 188.13,
          "end": 191.33,
          "en": "the text input and the button and the view that will hold",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 191.33,
          "end": 192.663,
          "en": "the list of goals later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 194.22,
          "end": 196.143,
          "en": "You can see that spacing here now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 197.64,
          "end": 201.15,
          "en": "We also could add a little border here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 201.15,
          "end": 203.1,
          "en": "so we could add a border to the bottom",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 203.1,
          "end": 207.833,
          "en": "and give it a width by setting border bottom width of one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 208.99,
          "end": 211.89,
          "en": "And then adding a border to the bottom and giving it a color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 211.89,
          "end": 215.323,
          "en": "of let's say, maybe this gray again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 216.73,
          "end": 219.03,
          "en": "But of course you can pick any color you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 219.95,
          "end": 223.083,
          "en": "Now we got this border and below that to the list of goals.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 224.15,
          "end": 227.01,
          "en": "But now I want to make sure that my text input area",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 227.01,
          "end": 232.01,
          "en": "takes up one fourth, so 1/4 of the overall available height.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 233.19,
          "end": 236.38,
          "en": "And this can be done with the flex property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 236.38,
          "end": 237.94,
          "en": "as you learned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 237.94,
          "end": 242.94,
          "en": "We can set this to one and then add a styling object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 243.96,
          "end": 246.9,
          "en": "to this view that holds the list of goals",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 246.9,
          "end": 251.14,
          "en": "that takes up three quarters of the available space,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 251.14,
          "end": 255.143,
          "en": "which can be achieved by adding flex three to this view.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 256.2,
          "end": 258.46,
          "en": "So therefore I'll add another styling object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 258.46,
          "end": 263.07,
          "en": "in my style sheet here and name it, the goals container.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 263.07,
          "end": 265.39300000000003,
          "en": "And here I'll set flex three.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 266.75,
          "end": 271.75,
          "en": "As you learned, all the flex values are added together",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 272.72,
          "end": 275.26,
          "en": "as long as the containers to which they are added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 275.26,
          "end": 278.64,
          "en": "are siblings to each other and are part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 278.64,
          "end": 281.83,
          "en": "of the same surrounding parent element which is the case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 281.83,
          "end": 283.58,
          "en": "for these two views",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 283.58,
          "end": 287.25,
          "en": "and then the space is distributed accordingly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 287.25,
          "end": 291.3,
          "en": "So one plus three is four and therefore this takes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 291.3,
          "end": 294.343,
          "en": "one fourth and this will take three quarters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 295.22,
          "end": 299.14,
          "en": "We just have to add this here, so I will add a style prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 299.14,
          "end": 303.643,
          "en": "to this view and set this equal to styles goals container.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 304.81,
          "end": 307.76,
          "en": "With that, it will look horrible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 307.76,
          "end": 309.93,
          "en": "And the reason for this is that we also need to work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 309.93,
          "end": 311.74,
          "en": "on the outer container now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 311.74,
          "end": 314.36,
          "en": "The container that holds these two containers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 314.36,
          "end": 317.023,
          "en": "on which we just set the flex properties.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 318.11,
          "end": 321.57,
          "en": "This outer container needs to take up the entire height",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 321.57,
          "end": 324.32,
          "en": "of the app so that the inner containers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 324.32,
          "end": 326.223,
          "en": "can then distribute this space.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 327.12,
          "end": 330.42,
          "en": "By default, without the flex property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 330.42,
          "end": 334.15,
          "en": "this container will only take as much space as it needs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 334.15,
          "end": 336.71,
          "en": "and that's only defined by the space",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 336.71,
          "end": 339.47,
          "en": "the content in the container takes up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 339.47,
          "end": 342.64,
          "en": "But now that we're setting flex on those containers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 342.64,
          "end": 345.55,
          "en": "in the container, this doesn't work anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 345.55,
          "end": 348.47,
          "en": "And to fix this, we need to force this container to take",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 348.47,
          "end": 352.89,
          "en": "all the available height and we do this by simply adding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 352.89,
          "end": 357.67,
          "en": "flex one to the app container so that the outer container",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 357.67,
          "end": 360.92,
          "en": "takes all the height because it's the only container here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 360.92,
          "end": 363.58,
          "en": "So flex one will give it all the space",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 363.58,
          "end": 366.59,
          "en": "and then the inner containers can divide",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 366.59,
          "end": 368.053,
          "en": "that available space.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 369.47,
          "end": 373.96,
          "en": "So by adding flex one to the app container and saving this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 373.96,
          "end": 375.37,
          "en": "this now looks better.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 375.37,
          "end": 380.223,
          "en": "And now this is a quarter and that here are three quarters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 381.86,
          "end": 383.58,
          "en": "Now if I look at it like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 383.58,
          "end": 386.91,
          "en": "this still doesn't look perfect so what we might wanna do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 386.91,
          "end": 391.91,
          "en": "is actually give that list here 4/5 of the available space,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 392.28,
          "end": 394.72,
          "en": "so that goals container will get four",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 394.72,
          "end": 396.963,
          "en": "and the input container stays at one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 398.09000000000003,
          "end": 400.89,
          "en": "And instead of setting a padding bottom,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 400.89,
          "end": 405.623,
          "en": "I will set a margin bottom here on the input container.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 407.46,
          "end": 409.31,
          "en": "And with that, that looks better.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 409.31,
          "end": 414.31,
          "en": "We could maybe even go to flex five down there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 414.43,
          "end": 415.76,
          "en": "and leave it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 415.76,
          "end": 417.95,
          "en": "Feel free to experiment with this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 417.95,
          "end": 419.61,
          "en": "and choose your own values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 419.61,
          "end": 423.59,
          "en": "But this will work for me and this is now flex box in action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 423.59,
          "end": 426.9,
          "en": "to achieve a first basic layout.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 426.9,
          "end": 430.273,
          "en": "Of course, this is not the final layout we will have though.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
